// Layered QVD architecture (Extract–Transform–Present) — QlikView 12 Data Architect (QV12DA)
// Goal: Separate extraction, modeling, and presentation into reusable QVD layers.
// Concepts: QVD layering, Extract vs transform vs present, Optimized loads, Reusability, Reload reliability
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

